---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Catering | Chai & Coffee for Vancouver Events | Sula"
	description="Live chai bars, specialty coffee stations, brunch boxes, and bakery platters. Sula Café catering for Vancouver offices, weddings, and private events."
	canonical="/catering"
	ogImage="/uploads/2026/02/brunch-catering-vancouver-sula-cafe.webp"
	breadcrumbs={[
		{ name: 'Home', url: '/' },
		{ name: 'Catering', url: '/catering' }
	]}
>

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Catering & Events</span>
			<h1>Flavors made for <em>every occasion.</em></h1>
			<div class="premium-divider">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-tagline">Bring artisanal chai, specialty coffee, and freshly baked goods to your office, celebration, or wedding. Served with warmth and simplicity.</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="/contact" class="cta">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</span>
					Book Catering
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Where Flavour Meets Celebration</span>
				<h2>Sula Café <em>catering, simplified.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Sula Café is the café and bakery extension of Sula Indian Restaurant, offering an intimate, chai-and-coffee-focused catering experience alongside Sula's full-service Indian catering. Where Sula Indian Restaurant specializes in large weddings and full menus, Sula Café caters to gatherings calling for artisanal chai, specialty coffee, and freshly baked goods served with warmth and simplicity. Notes on the <a href="/blog/pastries-coffee-pairing">best croissant in Vancouver</a> in our journal. From our <a href="/">coffee shop in East Vancouver</a>.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-img cocoa">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-star"></div>
				<img src="/uploads/2026/02/brunch-catering-vancouver-sula-cafe.webp" alt="Brunch catering Vancouver Sula Café" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Office & Corporate</span>
				<h2>Your office, <em>our café.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Great ideas flow over great flavours. Our office catering keeps your team refreshed and inspired with freshly brewed chai, specialty coffee, and perfectly paired baked snacks.</p>
				<p>From morning meetings to all-day conferences and team celebrations, we deliver seamless service with a touch of warmth. Customizable menus, flexible serving styles, and a team that handles every detail. Pour <a href="/coffee-and-chai-in-vancouver" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">chai in Vancouver</a> at your next team event.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Live Chai Stations</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Coffee Bars</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Bakery Platters</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Brunch Boxes</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">Private Gatherings</span>
				<h2>Celebrate <em>with flavour.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Private gatherings are about connection, and nothing brings people together like sharing a warm cup. From curated chai and coffee bars to beautifully arranged baked platters, we create catering that complements the spirit of your celebration.</p>
				<p>Birthdays, anniversaries, milestones, intimate get-togethers. Handcrafted brews served with care, menus tailored to your tastes. Comfort, celebration, and moments meant to be shared.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Birthdays</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Anniversaries</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Showers</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Weddings</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-img espresso">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-block"></div>
				<img src="/uploads/2026/02/croissaint-near-me-vancouver-sula-cafe.webp" alt="Private party catering Sula Café Vancouver" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner tl"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner br"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">What We Bring</span>
				<h2>Stations, platters, <em>seamless service.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Whether it's a quick coffee break, an afternoon tea setup, or a full spread for corporate events, we make hosting effortless. For ongoing supply, see our <a href="/wholesale" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">wholesale bakery in Vancouver</a>.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2026/02/chai-near-me-vancouver-sula-chai-cafe.webp" alt="Chai Stations Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Live Stations</span>
						<h3>Chai <em>Stations</em></h3>
						<p>Live brew stations with masala chai, lavender, gulabi chai, pistachio chai, and spicy ginger. Theatrical, fragrant, memorable.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2026/02/alai-coffee-vancouver.webp" alt="Coffee Bar Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Specialty Bar</span>
						<h3>Coffee <em>Bars</em></h3>
						<p>Full Alai Coffee menu, jaggery latte, masala monsoon, malai pista mocha, Indian filter coffee, espresso shots.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2026/02/croissaint-near-me-vancouver-sula-cafe.webp" alt="Bakery Platters" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sweet & Savoury</span>
						<h3>Bakery <em>Platters</em></h3>
						<p>Beautifully arranged platters of croissants, cruffins, cookies, pistachio loaves, and pain suisse.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2026/02/brunch-catering-vancouver-sula-cafe.webp" alt="Brunch Boxes Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Grab & Go</span>
						<h3>Brunch <em>Boxes</em></h3>
						<p>Curated boxes with paninis, samosas, pastries, and chai. Perfect for offices, meetings, and mobile events.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-200" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/samosa-near-me.webp" alt="Street Food Stations" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Interactive</span>
						<h3>Street Food <em>Stations</em></h3>
						<p>Hot samosas with chutneys, paninis pressed to order, masala soup served warm. Fresh and on demand.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-300" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/Lavender-chai.webp" alt="Afternoon Tea Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">High Tea</span>
						<h3>Afternoon <em>Tea</em></h3>
						<p>Tiered platters with finger sandwiches, scones with cream, sweet pastries, and a curated chai selection.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Morning Catering</span>
				<h2>Breakfast & brunch <em>spreads.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Start the day right. Hot chai, fresh espresso, and a spread of pastries, paninis, and savoury bites delivered to your venue.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/butter-croissiant-sula-cafe-vancouver.webp" alt="Breakfast Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Office Mornings</span>
						<h3>Breakfast <em>Catering</em></h3>
						<p>Croissants, samosas, fruit platters, hot chai, and freshly brewed coffee. Set up and ready before your team arrives.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/Pesto-chicken-tikka-panini.webp" alt="Brunch Catering" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Mid-Morning</span>
						<h3>Brunch <em>Catering</em></h3>
						<p>The full spread. Paninis, soups, pastries, savoury croissants, and a complete chai and coffee bar.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="photo-card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="photo-card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="photo-card-img">
						<img src="/uploads/2025/10/Rose-chai.webp" alt="Tea Service" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					</div>
					<div class="photo-card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Afternoons</span>
						<h3>Tea <em>Service</em></h3>
						<p>A relaxed afternoon spread with assorted chai, finger pastries, and savoury bites. Perfect for showers and intimate gatherings.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="faq">
		<div class="container container-narrow">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Catering Questions</span>
				<h2>Common questions <em>about catering.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Quick answers before you book.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-list">
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">What kinds of events do you cater?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Weddings, corporate lunches, private parties, birthdays. Everything from a 10-person boardroom to a 200-guest reception.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">How far in advance should I book?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>At least 2 weeks for small orders. 4 to 6 weeks for weddings and large events. Last minute is sometimes possible, just call.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you have a minimum order?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. $200 minimum for catering delivery in East Vancouver. Larger areas have higher minimums.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Where do you deliver?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Across Vancouver, Burnaby, and the Lower Mainland. Delivery fees scale with distance.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Can you do live chai bars at events?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Yes. Our live chai stations are a guest favourite. Five blends, brewed fresh on site.</p>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>
						<span class="faq-q">Do you handle dietary needs?</span>
						<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
					</summary>
					<div class="faq-a">
						<p>Vegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, halal options on every menu. Tell us what you need and we'll plan around it.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script type="application/ld+json" slot="schema" set:html={JSON.stringify({
		"@context": "https://schema.org",
		"@type": "FAQPage",
		"mainEntity": [
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "What kinds of events do you cater?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Weddings, corporate lunches, private parties, birthdays. Everything from a 10-person boardroom to a 200-guest reception." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "How far in advance should I book?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "At least 2 weeks for small orders. 4 to 6 weeks for weddings and large events. Last minute is sometimes possible, just call." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have a minimum order?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. $200 minimum for catering delivery in East Vancouver. Larger areas have higher minimums." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Where do you deliver?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Across Vancouver, Burnaby, and the Lower Mainland. Delivery fees scale with distance." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Can you do live chai bars at events?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Our live chai stations are a guest favourite. Five blends, brewed fresh on site." } },
			{ "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you handle dietary needs?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Vegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, halal options on every menu. Tell us what you need and we'll plan around it." } }
		]
	})} />

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Get In Touch</span>
			<h2>Let's plan <em>your event.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p style="max-width:620px;margin:24px auto 36px">Tell us about your event and we'll send a custom proposal within 24 hours. Live stations, take-away catering, or anything in between. Browse our <a href="/menu" class="body-link" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">coffee and bakery in Vancouver</a> menu for what we serve.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="cta">
				<span class="cta-badge">
					<img src="/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				</span>
				Book Catering
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
